> Searched wiki + newsgroups and couldn't find an answer. How much
> benefit is there to digging up ALL rock in the mines? I've dug up a
> good deal of the 1st mines level and scored some gold but so far it
> hasn't produced much. Does it increase my axe skill? Will my pick axe
> degrade with use?

Compared to the main dungeon, there is more gold and gems embedded in
the rock of the mines than in other levels.  That's the benefit and it's
a small one unless you really want more gold to purchase something. 
Even with the higher mineralization level it's a lot of work to get a
little gold, some glass and a tiny number of valuable gems.  Oject
detection gives a much more efficient dig.


